      <p class="eyebrow">KEEP WRITING</p>
      <p class="footer-title">把值得留下的东西，慢慢写下来。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-meta">
      <p>© {year} {SITE.author}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p><a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> · <a href="/sitemap-index.xml">Sitemap</a> · <a href="/privacy/">隐私</a></p>
      <p>Built with Astro.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
